1
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:40,800
[Her Willing Subject]

2
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:43,680
[Episode 6]

3
00:00:44,880 --> 00:00:45,670
Shen Shuying.

4
00:00:46,470 --> 00:00:48,030
His Highness means to kill me.

5
00:00:48,030 --> 00:00:49,110
I will not dodge.

6
00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:51,000
Let him see

7
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:53,320
who you truly hold in your heart.

8
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:56,560
The Yin-Yang Gu has been cast.

9
00:00:56,840 --> 00:00:58,520
Lu Qingcang and I now share one life.

10
00:00:58,600 --> 00:00:59,880
If Xiao Ningze kills him,

11
00:01:00,070 --> 00:01:01,150
I won't live much longer either.

12
00:01:01,790 --> 00:01:02,560
You lunatic.

13
00:01:03,320 --> 00:01:04,560
Then go ahead and die.

14
00:01:18,230 --> 00:01:18,920
Stop!

15
00:01:31,790 --> 00:01:32,590
Are you courting death?

16
00:01:33,870 --> 00:01:35,950
With you protecting me, I won't die.

17
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:38,590
Your consort doesn't
appreciate your kindness.

18
00:01:39,120 --> 00:01:40,510
She took my side.

19
00:01:41,280 --> 00:01:42,230
Shen Shuying,

20
00:01:42,480 --> 00:01:43,480
what exactly do you mean?

21
00:01:49,070 --> 00:01:50,230
You may kill him,

22
00:01:50,310 --> 00:01:51,280
but not now.

23
00:01:51,280 --> 00:01:52,710
Stop lying to him.

24
00:01:52,710 --> 00:01:53,870
You just can't bear to let me die.

25
00:01:53,870 --> 00:01:54,640
Shut up!

26
00:01:55,350 --> 00:01:56,070
Fine, I'll shut up.

27
00:01:56,070 --> 00:01:57,480
Don't fall for his scheme.

28
00:01:57,480 --> 00:01:58,510
He's provoking you,

29
00:01:58,510 --> 00:01:59,840
trying to drive us apart.

30
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:01,640
Reason?

31
00:02:03,120 --> 00:02:04,840
The Ministry of War is
under Wei Chengjun's command.

32
00:02:04,870 --> 00:02:06,710
If you execute Lu Qingcang
without trial,

33
00:02:06,870 --> 00:02:08,630
the Ministry of War officials
won't cover for you.

34
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:10,960
Wei Chengjun already resents you.

35
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:12,560
This will only give him leverage.

36
00:02:12,910 --> 00:02:13,800
Your Highness,

37
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:15,750
the throne is what matters most.

38
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:18,840
One day,

39
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:22,000
I'll execute Lu Qingcang
with my own hands

40
00:02:22,750 --> 00:02:24,280
and you'll be satisfied.

41
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:29,240
Sure.

42
00:02:30,030 --> 00:02:32,240
Lu Qingcang may escape
the death penalty,

43
00:02:33,030 --> 00:02:34,400
but he won't escape punishment.

44
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:37,960
What...

45
00:02:38,520 --> 00:02:39,310
What are you doing?

46
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:43,400
You...

47
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:48,400
An eye for an eye.
You'll be dragged through the streets.

48
00:02:48,560 --> 00:02:49,960
Are you sure you choose him over me?

49
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:52,520
You were never an option.

50
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:57,800
Shen Shuying.

51
00:02:58,360 --> 00:02:59,150
Shen Shuying!

52
00:03:00,630 --> 00:03:01,120
Shen Shuying!

53
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:06,080
Vicious woman.

54
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:10,190
Scoundrel.

55
00:03:19,080 --> 00:03:19,710
Who did it?

56
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:40,470
Your Highness, it's been a while.

57
00:03:42,030 --> 00:03:42,870
General Wei.

58
00:03:43,430 --> 00:03:45,360
What brings you here?

59
00:03:49,310 --> 00:03:51,630
He is one of mine.

60
00:03:55,150 --> 00:03:57,240
So all this trouble Lu Qingcang caused

61
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:59,150
was to get close to Wei Chengjun

62
00:03:59,150 --> 00:04:00,590
and regain command of the Iron Cavalry.

63
00:04:01,590 --> 00:04:03,470
I know you wish to be the future
emperor's father-in-law,

64
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:05,520
but the Eighth Prince will not oblige.

65
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:06,560
As for the Eighth Prince,

66
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:08,680
I can help you win his heart.

67
00:04:08,750 --> 00:04:10,310
The face you lost to
the Eighth Prince,

68
00:04:10,310 --> 00:04:12,190
I can help you win it back.

69
00:04:12,910 --> 00:04:14,080
How can I trust you?

70
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:15,710
Protect my life,

71
00:04:16,310 --> 00:04:18,000
and this marriage will never happen.

72
00:04:18,070 --> 00:04:19,750
At the hour of Xu, the day after
the wedding,

73
00:04:19,830 --> 00:04:22,270
come to the city gate tower yourself,
General,

74
00:04:22,390 --> 00:04:23,950
and I will prove it to you.

75
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:25,830
I am here on official business.

76
00:04:26,510 --> 00:04:28,800
General Wei, why have you come?

77
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:30,270
Can't you see?

78
00:04:30,750 --> 00:04:32,950
I'm taking this man with me.

79
00:04:33,310 --> 00:04:34,310
Lu Qingcang

80
00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:36,310
fled His Majesty's
border defense order.

81
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:39,430
He's now under interrogation by
my Golden Armor Guard.

82
00:04:46,510 --> 00:04:47,750
I'm a rough man.

83
00:04:48,190 --> 00:04:49,310
I won't read it.

84
00:04:49,750 --> 00:04:51,240
Read it yourself.

85
00:04:54,080 --> 00:04:56,080
[The border defense order is revoked]

86
00:04:56,310 --> 00:04:57,120
What?

87
00:04:57,630 --> 00:04:59,630
Father is revoking Lu Qingcang's
border defense order?

88
00:05:01,190 --> 00:05:02,600
His Majesty is wise.

89
00:05:06,270 --> 00:05:08,310
Since I no longer need to go
to the border,

90
00:05:08,750 --> 00:05:09,630
Eighth Princess Consort,

91
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:12,430
untie me.

92
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:22,800
You've been working
with Wei Chengjun all along.

93
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:24,920
You joined Xiao Ningze against me,

94
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:27,360
and stole the Princess Consort title
from General Wei's daughter.

95
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:28,830
I just picked up what you left behind.

96
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:29,920
By the way,

97
00:05:30,270 --> 00:05:31,430
I should thank you.

98
00:05:32,120 --> 00:05:33,560
If he hadn't come to arrest me,

99
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:35,040
I couldn't have proven to General Wei

100
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:36,190
how important I am.

101
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:37,600
So,

102
00:05:38,070 --> 00:05:39,920
you had Lingxi marry in my place

103
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:43,040
just to lure Xiao Ningze here.

104
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:44,600
You really do understand me.

105
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:46,950
As expected of you, Lu Qingcang.

106
00:05:47,430 --> 00:05:48,560
Every move carefully planned.

107
00:05:48,750 --> 00:05:50,430
You used the Yin-Yang Gu
to control me,

108
00:05:50,430 --> 00:05:52,360
drove a wedge between
me and Xiao Ningze,

109
00:05:52,630 --> 00:05:54,120
and got close to General Wei.

110
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:55,870
Three birds with one stone.

111
00:05:56,040 --> 00:05:57,160
Four birds.

112
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:58,630
Most importantly,

113
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:01,510
you never truly became husband
and wife with Xiao Ningze.

114
00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:06,000
Cunning old fox.

115
00:06:06,750 --> 00:06:09,430
As expected of the Regent who stood
above all but one in your past life.

116
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:11,630
You flatter me.

117
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:13,190
Otherwise, how could I have fought

118
00:06:13,190 --> 00:06:14,870
a scheming empress who ruled it all

119
00:06:15,070 --> 00:06:16,560
and traded blow for blow with you?

120
00:06:17,630 --> 00:06:19,950
You look unwell, Your Highness.

121
00:06:20,270 --> 00:06:22,190
Do take care, both of you.

122
00:06:24,430 --> 00:06:26,040
I said in this life,

123
00:06:26,070 --> 00:06:27,630
I won't die so easily.

124
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:30,160
We'll keep fighting,

125
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:31,720
keep entangling.

126
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:39,870
Your Highness,

127
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:42,800
your wings aren't full yet,
and you dare defy me.

128
00:06:43,190 --> 00:06:44,510
There's a price for that.

129
00:07:02,830 --> 00:07:04,040
Panicking already?

130
00:07:10,750 --> 00:07:11,600
You were the one who told me

131
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:13,240
I didn't have to bother
with Wei Chengjun.

132
00:07:13,630 --> 00:07:15,160
Now he's set his sights on me,

133
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:16,480
and he's threatening me.

134
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:18,750
You don't want to be
Wei Chengjun's puppet,

135
00:07:19,270 --> 00:07:20,950
but you've already taken this step.

136
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:22,480
There's no turning back for you.

137
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:25,430
If he finds that prince before I do,

138
00:07:26,190 --> 00:07:27,560
I'll lose completely,

139
00:07:27,870 --> 00:07:29,160
and I'll have nothing left.

140
00:07:29,430 --> 00:07:30,310
Don't worry.

141
00:07:31,270 --> 00:07:33,750
Everything will proceed
as originally planned.

142
00:07:34,070 --> 00:07:36,390
Wei Chengjun will never
find that prince.

143
00:07:41,720 --> 00:07:42,510
Shuying,

144
00:07:43,390 --> 00:07:44,480
you're all I have.

145
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:45,870
I can only trust you.

146
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:48,630
For your imperial cause,

147
00:07:48,750 --> 00:07:50,040
and for my position as empress.

148
00:07:50,430 --> 00:07:52,070
I won't forget our agreement.

149
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:02,800
There's been a lot of gossip
in the Ministry of War lately.

150
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:05,720
Let's put off the audience
with Father and Mother for now.

151
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:06,430
I understand.

152
00:08:06,870 --> 00:08:08,600
Once everything settles down,

153
00:08:08,830 --> 00:08:10,070
we'll confirm my identity.

154
00:08:21,120 --> 00:08:23,000
Thank you, General Wei,
for saving my life.

155
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:25,950
The life you saved wasn't your own.

156
00:08:26,040 --> 00:08:28,190
You saved Shen Shuying's life.

157
00:08:29,830 --> 00:08:31,120
You are right.

158
00:08:31,510 --> 00:08:33,150
That Xiao Ningze is nothing but

159
00:08:33,150 --> 00:08:34,750
a wet-behind-the-ears brat.

160
00:08:34,750 --> 00:08:36,150
How strong can his wings be?

161
00:08:36,750 --> 00:08:38,600
He wants to marry Shen Shuying.

162
00:08:39,150 --> 00:08:40,670
Then I'll kill Shen Shuying

163
00:08:40,670 --> 00:08:42,120
so he can't marry her.

164
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:45,000
Shen Shuying is the Chancellor's
daughter.

165
00:08:45,080 --> 00:08:46,200
If you kill her,

166
00:08:46,390 --> 00:08:49,790
the whole court
will likely be outraged.

167
00:08:51,320 --> 00:08:52,960
I hold the Iron Cavalry in my hands.

168
00:08:53,360 --> 00:08:54,910
The army is power.

169
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:56,360
The Chancellor?

170
00:08:56,510 --> 00:08:58,390
I don't take him seriously at all.

171
00:08:59,080 --> 00:08:59,790
General,

172
00:09:00,550 --> 00:09:01,480
the voice of the people

173
00:09:02,200 --> 00:09:03,510
can capsize a boat too.

174
00:09:03,870 --> 00:09:04,750
Besides,

175
00:09:05,150 --> 00:09:06,910
Xiao Ningze is already disloyal.

176
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:08,550
If you force him,

177
00:09:08,840 --> 00:09:10,600
it may backfire.

178
00:09:11,480 --> 00:09:14,790
You're pleading for Shen Shuying?

179
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:16,870
I'm doing this for you too, General.

180
00:09:17,670 --> 00:09:18,670
As for the Eighth Prince,

181
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:20,750
I can help you win back his heart.

182
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:22,840
And the face you lost
to the Eighth Prince,

183
00:09:22,870 --> 00:09:25,000
I can help you get it back too.

184
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:28,200
I'm not helping you for free.

185
00:09:28,670 --> 00:09:31,360
Remember to keep
what you promised me.

186
00:09:33,320 --> 00:09:34,360
Three days.

187
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:36,720
I'll give you an answer, General.

188
00:09:36,750 --> 00:09:39,390
I'll make the Eighth Prince
submit to you

189
00:09:39,870 --> 00:09:41,240
and become your puppet.

190
00:09:42,910 --> 00:09:44,480
My Lady! My Lady!

191
00:09:44,510 --> 00:09:45,320
Bad news!

192
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:48,480
Lu Qingcang has announced he'll
find the prince within three days.

193
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:50,750
What's there to make a fuss about?

194
00:09:50,750 --> 00:09:53,270
If Lu Qingcang finds that
prince before we do,

195
00:09:53,360 --> 00:09:54,790
it'll be even harder for
us to gain a foothold.

196
00:09:55,630 --> 00:09:57,000
Forget three days.

197
00:09:57,000 --> 00:09:58,390
He couldn't find him in three years.

198
00:09:59,910 --> 00:10:01,480
In my last life, from birth to death,

199
00:10:01,510 --> 00:10:03,150
that person never appeared.

200
00:10:03,790 --> 00:10:05,270
It was only
when His Majesty was dying

201
00:10:05,440 --> 00:10:07,120
that he kept thinking
about that prince.

202
00:10:07,390 --> 00:10:09,550
So much so that the Eighth Prince,
to seize the throne,

203
00:10:10,120 --> 00:10:11,870
used some underhanded methods.

204
00:10:12,440 --> 00:10:14,150
But the people we sent

205
00:10:14,150 --> 00:10:16,720
to watch Lu Qingcang sent word

206
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:18,840
that they've already
found that prince.

207
00:10:20,270 --> 00:10:21,080
What?

208
00:10:37,270 --> 00:10:37,870
Please.

209
00:10:41,390 --> 00:10:43,200
Not even a fly can get in.

210
00:10:43,320 --> 00:10:43,960
Yes, sir!

211
00:10:50,510 --> 00:10:51,790
Could it be that in my last life,

212
00:10:51,790 --> 00:10:53,670
he had more information than I did,

213
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:55,550
so things have changed in this life?

214
00:11:25,540 --> 00:11:29,750
♪Moonlight spills over your hand
that holds the lantern♪

215
00:11:30,310 --> 00:11:34,520
♪Light and shadow chase
across the red wall♪

216
00:11:34,950 --> 00:11:39,160
♪Past entanglements,
how do we settle the score♪

217
00:11:39,660 --> 00:11:41,740
♪If fate turns once more♪

218
00:11:42,130 --> 00:11:44,590
♪Will our endings trade places♪

219
00:11:44,820 --> 00:11:49,500
♪Restraint or drawing near♪

220
00:11:49,610 --> 00:11:53,690
♪Tugging back and forth
between two hearts in resonance♪

221
00:11:54,240 --> 00:11:57,750
♪What tone should I take♪

222
00:11:57,860 --> 00:12:00,860
♪To leave no trace♪

223
00:12:01,000 --> 00:12:03,450
♪How can I keep my head clear♪

224
00:12:03,830 --> 00:12:08,160
♪But the moment you come close♪

225
00:12:08,660 --> 00:12:12,810
♪You burn through the distance
I fought to keep♪

226
00:12:13,300 --> 00:12:15,670
♪The lamplight flickers♪

227
00:12:15,670 --> 00:12:18,110
♪Like your eyes♪

228
00:12:18,180 --> 00:12:21,610
♪Already written into my fate♪

229
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:41,700
♪Something in my chest draws me near♪

230
00:12:42,060 --> 00:12:46,430
♪Like a silhouette, I move toward you♪

231
00:12:46,810 --> 00:12:51,230
♪The past lingers on,
yet my heart is in turmoil♪

232
00:12:51,570 --> 00:12:53,890
♪A test used as an excuse♪

233
00:12:53,890 --> 00:12:56,730
♪To stir the waters♪

234
00:12:56,730 --> 00:13:00,910
♪But the moment you come close♪

235
00:13:01,040 --> 00:13:05,780
♪You burn through the distance
I fought to keep♪

236
00:13:05,930 --> 00:13:08,280
♪The lamplight flickers♪

237
00:13:08,450 --> 00:13:10,710
♪Like your eyes♪

238
00:13:10,710 --> 00:13:15,170
♪Already written into my fate♪
